WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.204
Oliver was getting glasses.

2
00:00:08.205 --> 00:00:13.597
"I don't want to wear glasses," said Oliver.

3
00:00:13.598 --> 00:00:28.678
"Glasses will help you to see," said Mom.

4
00:00:28.679 --> 00:00:32.110
"I can see fine now," Oliver grumbled.

5
00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:40.469
Mom and Oliver drove to the store.

6
00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:47.494
Oliver put on his new glasses.

7
00:00:47.495 --> 00:00:51.335
"I look terrible," said Oliver.

8
00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:55.155
"You look handsome," said Mom.

9
00:00:55.156 --> 00:00:59.495
"And now you will see much better."

10
00:00:59.496 --> 00:01:03.795
That night the ice cream truck came.

11
00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:12.576
Mom gave Harry a bunch of coins.

12
00:01:12.577 --> 00:01:17.673
The kids ran after the ice cream truck.

13
00:01:17.674 --> 00:01:21.050
"Wait!" yelled Oliver.

14
00:01:21.051 --> 00:01:25.618
"We want ice cream!" yelled Harry.

15
00:01:25.619 --> 00:01:30.102
Oliver, Harry, and Emmy raced down the street.

16
00:01:30.103 --> 00:01:32.577
Suddenly Harry

17
00:01:32.578 --> 00:01:35.146
tripped. All the money flew into the

18
00:01:35.147 --> 00:01:40.742
air. Coins bounced all over the

19
00:01:40.743 --> 00:01:46.019
sidewalk. The kids picked up the

20
00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:49.650
coins. But two coins were still

21
00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:53.278
missing. "Oh no," said

22
00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:57.652
Emmy. "We don't have enough

23
00:01:57.653 --> 00:02:05.128
money." "Now we can't get ice cream," said

24
00:02:05.129 --> 00:02:09.666
Harry. Just then Oliver spotted

25
00:02:09.667 --> 00:02:14.471
something. It was two shiny

26
00:02:14.472 --> 00:02:19.845
quarters! "We can get ice cream!" said

27
00:02:19.846 --> 00:02:23.603
Oliver. "Good job, Oliver!" said

28
00:02:23.604 --> 00:02:32.543
Emmy. "You found the missing

29
00:02:32.544 --> 00:02:35.928
coins." "Mmm . . .," said Harry.

30
00:02:35.929 --> 00:02:40.252
"I love ice cream," said Emmy.

31
00:02:40.253 --> 00:02:43.491
"Me too," said Oliver.

32
00:02:43.492 --> 00:02:48.905
"I'm so glad that I got new glasses!"

